{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/38ff73416fdd8432eb34833246daccd0.avif?t=1770649307\" width=632 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your character</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/254187af2bb24c813a5350e7144bb7b7.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/254187af2bb24c813a5350e7144bb7b7.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/254187af2bb24c813a5350e7144bb7b7.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your hair, eyes, nose and skin or just randomize it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drink and Pee</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/505557ca4cc8f3ab88aae54b96c0e151.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/505557ca4cc8f3ab88aae54b96c0e151.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/505557ca4cc8f3ab88aae54b96c0e151.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your right trigger controls the angle and your right stick the direction. It will turn yellow when it's about to run out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement Speed, Climbing and Sliping</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/097aa6271b9bff9be86172ad30baeaf4.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/097aa6271b9bff9be86172ad30baeaf4.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/097aa6271b9bff9be86172ad30baeaf4.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your movement speed is progressive and you will not be able to run immediately if you stop or get stunned.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/4bcd0b532dd9009dd4b06bbc9cdd2ff4.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/4bcd0b532dd9009dd4b06bbc9cdd2ff4.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/4bcd0b532dd9009dd4b06bbc9cdd2ff4.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can climb everything except rocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/5b4f0c10ca6a4b01a36cd706589edf21.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/5b4f0c10ca6a4b01a36cd706589edf21.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/5b4f0c10ca6a4b01a36cd706589edf21.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you slip, only a flat surface will stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab and Throw / Bury</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/f0a9e5da03afc0e6ad80fbb0f187129e.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/f0a9e5da03afc0e6ad80fbb0f187129e.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/f0a9e5da03afc0e6ad80fbb0f187129e.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab and throw whatever you see on the map, each element behaves in a different way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/863aa2654983acce07c9c8ab726b148b.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/863aa2654983acce07c9c8ab726b148b.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/863aa2654983acce07c9c8ab726b148b.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also bury, if you do it in the air it will launch you up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stun</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/46a13b7c6b91e3920067dd1c683a3d88.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/46a13b7c6b91e3920067dd1c683a3d88.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/46a13b7c6b91e3920067dd1c683a3d88.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stun your enemies by throwing or burying things, the effect will be different depending on what you throw at them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Damage and Abilities</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/c0191d77f7b541962b2e30dc770af73a.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/c0191d77f7b541962b2e30dc770af73a.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/c0191d77f7b541962b2e30dc770af73a.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/40ffca06f91e7e6d7e71d0df7a6f4049.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/40ffca06f91e7e6d7e71d0df7a6f4049.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/40ffca06f91e7e6d7e71d0df7a6f4049.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/6c796994e9ff6ff433771c7245e498c4.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/6c796994e9ff6ff433771c7245e498c4.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/6c796994e9ff6ff433771c7245e498c4.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/794fe7f759319ea5246e881731360fb3.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/794fe7f759319ea5246e881731360fb3.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/794fe7f759319ea5246e881731360fb3.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat the fruits to gain abilities. All fluids hurt opponents, some powers can be combined with stage elements in creative ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will lose when all your hair is gone and all your skin falls off.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/d17ac15ddaa4ccd23c36aa070bff2a33.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/d17ac15ddaa4ccd23c36aa070bff2a33.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/d17ac15ddaa4ccd23c36aa070bff2a33.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 player local (for now).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is being developed completely by a single person, all the assets, animations, programming, sound and other elements that make it up have been made by <strong>Emmanuel Crispi</strong>. </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rocket Monke","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3374840/6692d545d43d7fe8985282f72a97091a06d1f6f4.jpg"},{"name":"Collateral Crapage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3374840/43b0055cb27a3c18991eb51c6dfd93422da408e2.jpg"},{"name":"Well\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3374840/07006adc60c930ab387fb9b1b6a48e39d55d67f3.jpg"},{"name":"Safe Landing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3374840/bdc8ba8d61f7dcb93f9570ecfb14e40fc1b3bf88.jpg"},{"name":"sNot Today","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3374840/1d7cf931ed4d8368a1754ea475e5dbdc8deca0c5.jpg"},{"name":"Gaslighting","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3374840/00ada5662b06868a63401b5243905ff1697916b8.jpg"},{"name":"Total Purge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3374840/253aaad1ffb5dd09d8349dc1ca361616309f0076.jpg"},{"name":"Professional Crybaby","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3374840/8dad95db53a82352ebd51e05ec9ab0ac9ee88d7f.jpg"},{"name":"I N F L A T I O N","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3374840/521472e6ce134d111c4b1680c3132a6f42b7dd4b.jpg"},{"name":"Stone-Cold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3374840/d139ce815dde2f2f43d735a8f55a56152d71e5b5.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3374840?t=1770649307","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770649307","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/dfa770664fc489156929ae91423738c5a80766db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770649307","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/dfa770664fc489156929ae91423738c5a80766db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770649307","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains crude humor, cartoonish violence, and scatological themes. While presented in a comedic and absurd way, it may not be suitable for all audiences."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/38ff73416fdd8432eb34833246daccd0.avif?t=1770649307\" width=632 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your character</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/254187af2bb24c813a5350e7144bb7b7.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/254187af2bb24c813a5350e7144bb7b7.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/254187af2bb24c813a5350e7144bb7b7.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your hair, eyes, nose and skin or just randomize it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drink and Pee</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/505557ca4cc8f3ab88aae54b96c0e151.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/505557ca4cc8f3ab88aae54b96c0e151.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/505557ca4cc8f3ab88aae54b96c0e151.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your right trigger controls the angle and your right stick the direction. It will turn yellow when it's about to run out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement Speed, Climbing and Sliping</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/097aa6271b9bff9be86172ad30baeaf4.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/097aa6271b9bff9be86172ad30baeaf4.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/097aa6271b9bff9be86172ad30baeaf4.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your movement speed is progressive and you will not be able to run immediately if you stop or get stunned.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/4bcd0b532dd9009dd4b06bbc9cdd2ff4.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/4bcd0b532dd9009dd4b06bbc9cdd2ff4.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/4bcd0b532dd9009dd4b06bbc9cdd2ff4.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can climb everything except rocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/5b4f0c10ca6a4b01a36cd706589edf21.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/5b4f0c10ca6a4b01a36cd706589edf21.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/5b4f0c10ca6a4b01a36cd706589edf21.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you slip, only a flat surface will stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab and Throw / Bury</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/f0a9e5da03afc0e6ad80fbb0f187129e.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/f0a9e5da03afc0e6ad80fbb0f187129e.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/f0a9e5da03afc0e6ad80fbb0f187129e.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab and throw whatever you see on the map, each element behaves in a different way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/863aa2654983acce07c9c8ab726b148b.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/863aa2654983acce07c9c8ab726b148b.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/863aa2654983acce07c9c8ab726b148b.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also bury, if you do it in the air it will launch you up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stun</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/46a13b7c6b91e3920067dd1c683a3d88.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/46a13b7c6b91e3920067dd1c683a3d88.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/46a13b7c6b91e3920067dd1c683a3d88.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stun your enemies by throwing or burying things, the effect will be different depending on what you throw at them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Damage and Abilities</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/c0191d77f7b541962b2e30dc770af73a.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/c0191d77f7b541962b2e30dc770af73a.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/c0191d77f7b541962b2e30dc770af73a.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/40ffca06f91e7e6d7e71d0df7a6f4049.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/40ffca06f91e7e6d7e71d0df7a6f4049.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/40ffca06f91e7e6d7e71d0df7a6f4049.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/6c796994e9ff6ff433771c7245e498c4.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/6c796994e9ff6ff433771c7245e498c4.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/6c796994e9ff6ff433771c7245e498c4.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/794fe7f759319ea5246e881731360fb3.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/794fe7f759319ea5246e881731360fb3.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/794fe7f759319ea5246e881731360fb3.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat the fruits to gain abilities. All fluids hurt opponents, some powers can be combined with stage elements in creative ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will lose when all your hair is gone and all your skin falls off.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/d17ac15ddaa4ccd23c36aa070bff2a33.poster.avif?t=1770649307\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/d17ac15ddaa4ccd23c36aa070bff2a33.webm?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/extras/d17ac15ddaa4ccd23c36aa070bff2a33.mp4?t=1770649307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 player local (for now).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is being developed completely by a single person, all the assets, animations, programming, sound and other elements that make it up have been made by <strong>Emmanuel Crispi</strong>. </p>","developers":["Emmanuel Crispi"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374840/bd1e022680a24eddfe8d1f345d9880517b81c6b9/header.jpg?t=1770649307","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright Notice<br>This game and all related assets, including but not limited to artwork, sound effects, music, and code, are <strong> \u00a9Emmanuel Crispi/Polygonec/PolyMess , 2024</strong>. All rights reserved. Unauthorized reproduction, distribution, or modification of this game or its assets is strictly prohibited.<br><br>Trademark and Patent Pending Notice<br>The game title, logos, and branding are trademarks of <strong>Emmanuel Crispi/Polygonec/PolyMess</strong>. Patent pending.<br><br>Original Content<br>All assets used in this game, including visuals, audio, and gameplay mechanics, a